# ─── Magento backend (markshust/docker-magento) ───────────────────────────
# The Magento install itself is huge and licensed — recreate it with
# `bin/download community 2.4.9 && bin/setup magento.test` (see README).
# Anchored with a leading slash so it only matches the top-level Magento src,
# NOT the storefront's Next.js src/ directory.
/src/
/compose.versions.yaml

# ─── Proprietary vendor source ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Magezon Page Builder is commercial code (© 2019 Magezon). Install it from
# your own Magezon license into src/app/code/Magezon — it is not redistributed.
/Magezon/

# ─── Generated TLS certificates (regenerate with `bin/setup-ssl magento.test`)
/certs/
/rootCA.pem
*.pem

# ─── Local credentials / scratch notes (never commit) ─────────────────────
/info.md
# Install-time admin credentials — copy env/magento.env.sample -> env/magento.env
env/magento.env

# ─── Node / Next.js (the storefront also has its own .gitignore) ──────────
node_modules/
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ─── OS / editor cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
